## The weapons (66)

Each hero's `loadout.weapons` lists the weapons the HUD can show for him: the
primary weapon, and a second one only where the hero really swaps weapon or
form. **All 54 hero pages on overwatch.blizzard.com were read on 2026-10-10**
(every hero's first source is its page); every weapon name below is spelt
as it appears there. The ten heroes with more than one:

| Hero | Weapons |
|---|---|
| Bastion | Configuration: Recon, Configuration: Assault, Configuration: Artillery (the ultimate) |
| D.Va | Fusion Cannons (in the mech), Light Gun (out of it) |
| D.Mon | Plasma Saber, Portable Fusion Repeater, Fusion Repeater (the page's order; how they map to the HUD is unconfirmed, both marked `uncertain`) |
| Genji | Shuriken, Dragonblade (the ultimate) |
| Mercy | Caduceus Staff (beam, no ammo), Caduceus Blaster (ammo shows) |
| Torbjörn | Rivet Gun, Forge Hammer |
| Ramattra | Void Accelerator (the page: "(Omnic Form)"), Pummel ("(Nemesis Form)") |
| Mauga | Incendiary Chaingun, Volatile Chaingun (both at once, two counters) |
| Kiriko | Healing Ofuda, Kunai |
| Lifeweaver | Healing Blossom, Thorn Volley |

